<template>
  <section v-if="research" class="research-panel">
    <header><div><h2>{{ report ? '实验与证据附录' : '专家研究与实验' }}</h2><p>{{ research.config.model_label }}<span v-if="research.config.model_kind === 'saved'"> · v{{ research.config.model.version }}</span></p></div><span class="stage-tag">{{ stageText }}</span></header>
    <div v-if="!report" class="research-steps"><span v-for="(step, index) in steps" :key="step" :class="{ reached: index <= stageIndex }">{{ index + 1 }} {{ step }}</span></div>
    <p v-if="research.data_summary?.year && research.config.engine !== 'expert_agents_v1'" class="note">系统数据：{{ research.data_summary.year }} 年历史产量 · {{ research.data_summary.country_count }} 个国家。实际年份与议题时间可能不同，仅作历史基准情景对照。</p>
    <p v-if="research.planning_note" class="note">{{ research.planning_note }}</p>
    <details v-if="research.config.procurement_case" class="case-input"><summary>本场已提供的采购案例输入（tU）</summary><p>决策日 {{ research.config.procurement_case.as_of }}；可用库存 {{ research.config.procurement_case.available_inventory }} tU；剩余需求 {{ research.config.procurement_case.remaining_demand }} tU；期末目标 {{ research.config.procurement_case.closing_target }} tU。</p><p>均匀消耗窗口：{{ research.config.procurement_case.consumption_start }} 至 {{ research.config.procurement_case.window_end }}。已签预计到货：{{ research.config.procurement_case.scheduled_receipts.map(row => `${row.date}：${row.quantity_tu} tU`).join('；') }}。</p><p class="note">这是本场确认的案例输入，独立于专家个人知识库。工具按日初验收可用、日末消耗复算；40 tU为期末目标。专家提出的新到货计划和延迟为待验证方案。</p></details>
    <details v-if="controllerChecks.length"><summary>系统复算补证（{{ controllerChecks.length }}）</summary><article v-for="check in controllerChecks" :key="check.id"><h4>{{ check.label }} · {{ check.display_code }}</h4><p>新增验收计划：{{ check.inputs.new_receipts.map(row => `${row.date}：${row.quantity_tu} tU`).join('；') }}。</p><p>全部未到货旧单和新单延迟 {{ check.inputs.delay_days }} 天：首次缺口 {{ check.result.perturbed.first_shortage_date || '无' }}；最低净余额 {{ check.result.perturbed.minimum_net_balance_tu }} tU；期末 {{ check.result.perturbed.closing_inventory_tu }} tU。</p><p class="note">{{ check.note }} 系统工具复算独立于专家原有实验，作为后续复议的可追溯补证。</p></article></details>
    <SeminarAgentStatus v-if="research.agents" :agents="research.agents" @open-experiment="openExperiment" />
    <p v-if="!research.plans?.length" class="note">{{ research.config.engine === 'expert_agents_v1' ? research.stage === 'planned' ? '数据与工具已准备，启动后由每位专家独立提出假设并选择模型。' : '各专家正在独立检索资料、设计实验；实际模型结果会陆续显示。' : '正在结合议题与专家职责生成实验计划…' }}</p>
    <div class="plan-list">
      <article v-for="plan in research.plans" :key="plan.id" class="plan-card"><div class="plan-title"><strong>{{ plan.expert }}</strong><span>{{ plan.label }}</span><small>{{ plan.proposal_source === 'agent' ? 'Agent 自主设计' : plan.proposal_source === 'model' ? '智能分配' : '模板分配' }}</small></div><p>{{ plan.hypothesis }}</p><p class="note">{{ plan.rationale }}</p>
        <template v-if="recordFor(plan)"><div class="result-values"><template v-if="recordFor(plan).baseline?.value != null"><span>基准 <b>{{ formatValue(recordFor(plan).baseline) }}</b></span><span>对照 <b>{{ formatValue(recordFor(plan).stress) }}</b></span></template><span v-for="metric in recordFor(plan).metrics || []" :key="metric.label">{{ metric.label }} <b>{{ metric.value }}</b></span><strong :class="{ insufficient: recordFor(plan).status !== 'completed' }">{{ recordFor(plan).outcome }}</strong></div><p v-if="recordFor(plan).agent_assessment">{{ recordFor(plan).agent_assessment }}</p><p v-if="recordFor(plan).error" class="error">{{ recordFor(plan).error }}</p><p v-if="recordFor(plan).maturity" class="note">{{ recordFor(plan).maturity }}</p><p v-if="recordFor(plan).missing?.length" class="note">缺少：{{ recordFor(plan).missing.join('、') }}</p><button type="button" class="link" @click="openExperiment(recordFor(plan).id)">{{ recordFor(plan).display_code }} · 查看实验卡与模型输出</button></template>
        <details v-else-if="research.stage === 'planned' && research.config.data_mode !== 'system' && !report"><summary>确认或补充本次数据</summary><SeminarResearchData :model-value="datasets[plan.expert] || {}" :unit="dataUnit" @update:model-value="datasets[plan.expert] = $event" /></details>
      </article>
    </div>
    <details class="ontology-detail"><summary>本体关联 · {{ ontologyText }}</summary><p class="note">{{ research.ontology?.note || '本体网络提供关系线索，不作为业务数值或因果证明。' }}</p><p v-if="research.ontology?.query">查询对象：{{ research.ontology.query }}</p><ul v-if="research.ontology?.edges?.length"><li v-for="(edge, index) in research.ontology.edges" :key="index">{{ nodeLabel(edge.source) }} → {{ edge.relation || edge.type || edge.label || '关联' }} → {{ nodeLabel(edge.target) }}</li></ul><p v-else class="note">本次没有可展示的关系路径。</p></details>
    <p class="note">专家独立研究后共享实验卡，交叉复核再讨论。工作记忆仅保存在本场，不会把假设自动写成知识库事实。专业模型的数据就绪度与适用边界随结果保留。</p>
    <p v-if="error" class="error">{{ error }}</p>
    <div v-if="!report" class="actions"><button v-if="canResumeAgents" class="primary" :disabled="busy" @click="run(true)">{{ busy ? '恢复中…' : '恢复未完成专家研究' }}</button><button v-if="research.stage === 'planned'" class="primary" :disabled="busy" @click="run()">{{ busy ? '启动中…' : '启动专家研究并进入研讨' }}</button><template v-if="['completed', 'failed'].includes(seminar.status)"><label>复核扰动幅度（%）<input v-model.number="reviewPercent" type="number" min="0" max="100"></label><button :disabled="busy" @click="replicate">{{ busy ? '正在发起…' : '以新参数发起复核研讨' }}</button></template></div>
    <ElDrawer v-model="drawer" title="实验记录与研究依据" size="min(620px, 95vw)" append-to-body>
      <div v-if="selectedRecord" class="experiment-drawer"><h3>{{ selectedRecord.display_code }} · {{ selectedRecord.label }}</h3><p>{{ selectedRecord.expert }} · {{ selectedRecord.created_at }}</p><h4>待检验假设</h4><p>{{ selectedRecord.hypothesis }}</p><h4>模型结果与检验</h4><p v-if="selectedRecord.error" class="error">{{ selectedRecord.error }}</p><template v-if="selectedRecord.baseline?.value != null"><table><thead><tr><th>情景</th><th>结果</th><th>状态</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr v-for="key in ['baseline', 'stress']" :key="key"><td>{{ key === 'baseline' ? '基准' : '扰动' }}</td><td>{{ formatValue(selectedRecord[key]) }}</td><td>{{ selectedRecord[key].status === 'computed' ? '已计算' : selectedRecord[key].reason }}</td></tr></tbody></table><p>变化量：{{ selectedRecord.delta == null ? '无法计算' : Number(selectedRecord.delta.toFixed(4)) }}</p></template><p>判据：{{ selectedRecord.criterion }}<span v-if="selectedRecord.tool === 'coverage' && selectedRecord.target_days"> · 保障目标 {{ selectedRecord.target_days }} 天</span></p><p>结果：{{ selectedRecord.outcome }}</p><p v-if="selectedRecord.agent_assessment">专家评估：{{ selectedRecord.agent_assessment }}</p><p v-if="selectedRecord.maturity">模型成熟度：{{ selectedRecord.maturity }}</p><p v-if="selectedRecord.readiness">数据就绪度：{{ selectedRecord.readiness }}</p><details v-if="selectedRecord.result"><summary>完整模型输出</summary><pre>{{ JSON.stringify(selectedRecord.result, null, 2) }}</pre></details><h4>输入与方法</h4><p>对象：{{ selectedRecord.object || '未命名' }}<br>来源：{{ selectedRecord.data_source || '未提供' }}<br>时间：{{ selectedRecord.window || '未提供' }}</p><p>{{ selectedRecord.method }}<span v-if="['coverage', 'gap', 'production_loss'].includes(selectedRecord.tool)"> {{ selectedRecord.perturbation }}%</span></p><pre>{{ JSON.stringify(selectedRecord.inputs, null, 2) }}</pre><p v-if="selectedRecord.formula">公式：{{ selectedRecord.formula }}</p><p>{{ selectedRecord.model_label }} · 版本 {{ selectedRecord.model_version || '基础模板' }}</p><details><summary>复现标识</summary><p>实验 ID：{{ selectedRecord.id }}</p><p>输入快照：{{ selectedRecord.input_hash || selectedRecord.model_hash }}</p><p v-if="research.ontology?.snapshot_hash">本体快照：{{ research.ontology.snapshot_hash }}</p></details><p class="note">{{ selectedRecord.note }}</p></div>
    </ElDrawer>
  </section>
</template>
<script setup>
import { computed, ref, watch } from 'vue'
import { ElDrawer } from 'element-plus'
import { runSeminarResearch, replicateSeminarResearch } from '@/api/expertSeminar'
import SeminarResearchData from './SeminarResearchData.vue'
import SeminarAgentStatus from './SeminarAgentStatus.vue'
const props = defineProps({ seminar: { type: Object, required: true }, report: Boolean })
const emit = defineEmits(['updated', 'open-seminar'])
const research = computed(() => props.seminar.research)
const datasets = ref({})
const drawer = ref(false)
const selectedRecord = ref(null)
const busy = ref(false)
const error = ref('')
const reviewPercent = ref(20)
const steps = computed(() => research.value?.config.engine === 'expert_agents_v1' ? ['准备专家', '提出假设', '模型实验', '交叉讨论', '形成结论'] : ['生成假设', '确认实验', '本地计算', '逐轮讨论', '形成结论'])
const stageIndex = computed(() => ({ preparing: 0, planned: 1, agent_research: 2, results: 2, discussion: 3, completed: 4 }[research.value?.stage] ?? 0))
const stageText = computed(() => props.seminar.status === 'failed' ? '研究未完成，请查看原因' : ({ preparing: '准备专家与数据', planned: '等待启动', agent_research: '专家自主研究中', results: '计算完成', discussion: '正在讨论', completed: '研讨完成' }[research.value?.stage] || '研究准备'))
const controllerChecks = computed(() => (props.seminar.controller_checks || []).filter(row => row.tool === 'analyze_procurement' && row.status === 'completed'))
const canResumeAgents = computed(() => props.seminar.status !== 'running' && Object.values(research.value?.agents || {}).some(agent => ['failed', 'limited'].includes(agent.status)))
const dataUnit = computed(() => research.value?.config.model?.inputs?.find(row => row.id === 'inventory')?.unit || 'tU')
const ontologyText = computed(() => ({ matched: `${research.value?.ontology?.nodes?.length || 0} 个对象 · ${research.value?.ontology?.edges?.length || 0} 条关系`, off: '未启用', empty: '未找到匹配', unavailable: '尚未接入', failed: '查询失败' }[research.value?.ontology?.status] || '查询中'))
watch(() => props.seminar.seminar_id + ':' + props.seminar.research?.stage, () => { datasets.value = JSON.parse(JSON.stringify(props.seminar.research?.config.expert_data || {})); reviewPercent.value = props.seminar.research?.config.perturbation ?? 20; error.value = '' }, { immediate: true })
const recordFor = plan => research.value.experiments?.find(row => row.plan_id === plan.id)
const formatValue = output => output?.value == null ? '未计算' : `${Number(output.value.toFixed(4))}${output.unit === '1' ? '' : ` ${output.unit}`}`
const nodeLabel = id => research.value.ontology?.nodes?.find(row => String(row.id) === String(id))?.label || id
function openExperiment(id) { selectedRecord.value = research.value.experiments?.find(row => row.id === id); drawer.value = !!selectedRecord.value }
async function run(resume = false) { busy.value = true; error.value = ''; try { const result = await runSeminarResearch(props.seminar.seminar_id, { expert_data: datasets.value, resume_failed_agents: resume === true }); emit('updated', result.data || result) } catch (err) { error.value = err.message || '实验执行失败' } finally { busy.value = false } }
async function replicate() { busy.value = true; error.value = ''; try { const result = await replicateSeminarResearch(props.seminar.seminar_id, { perturbation: reviewPercent.value }); emit('open-seminar', (result.data || result).seminar_id) } catch (err) { error.value = err.message || '复核发起失败' } finally { busy.value = false } }
defineExpose({ openExperiment })
</script>
<style scoped>
.research-panel{padding:20px;background:#fff;border:1px solid #dbe6f5;border-radius:13px;margin:16px 0}.research-panel header{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:10px}.research-panel h2{font-size:16px;margin:0}.research-panel header p,.note{font-size:12px;color:#72849e;line-height:1.7}.stage-tag{font-size:12px;background:#eaf3ff;color:#2465b5;padding:6px 10px;border-radius:15px}.research-steps{display:flex;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin:14px 0}.research-steps span{font-size:12px;padding:8px 12px;background:#f3f6fa;color:#8d9aaf;border-radius:7px}.research-steps .reached{background:#eaf3ff;color:#2862a9}.plan-card{padding:15px;border:1px solid #e1eaf4;border-radius:9px;margin:10px 0}.plan-card p{font-size:13px;line-height:1.7}.plan-title{display:flex;gap:12px;align-items:center;flex-wrap:wrap;font-size:13px}.plan-title span,.plan-title small{color:#7b8ba1;font-size:12px}.result-values{display:flex;gap:20px;flex-wrap:wrap;align-items:center;font-size:12px;margin:12px 0}.result-values b{font-size:17px;color:#245e8d;margin-left:6px}.result-values strong{color:#198555}.result-values .insufficient{color:#b37c22}.research-panel button{border:1px solid #b8cfee;background:white;color:#2462ac;border-radius:7px;padding:9px 12px;font:inherit;cursor:pointer;font-size:12px}.research-panel button.primary{background:#1d66d3;color:#fff;border-color:#1d66d3}.research-panel button.link{border:0;padding:4px 0}.research-panel button:disabled{opacity:.6;cursor:wait}.research-panel details{margin:12px 0;font-size:12px;color:#59718d}.research-panel summary{cursor:pointer}.ontology-detail li{margin:6px 0}.actions{display:flex;gap:12px;align-items:flex-end;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-top:15px}.actions label{font-size:12px;color:#5c7491;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:6px}.actions input{padding:8px;width:140px;border:1px solid #d9e5f3;border-radius:7px}.error{color:#b93838;font-size:12px}.experiment-drawer{color:#324c67;font-size:13px;line-height:1.8}.experiment-drawer h3{margin-top:0}.experiment-drawer h4{margin:22px 0 8px}.experiment-drawer table{width:100%;border-collapse:collapse}.experiment-drawer th,.experiment-drawer td{padding:9px;text-align:left;border-bottom:1px solid #e4ebf5}.experiment-drawer pre{background:#f5f8fc;border-radius:8px;padding:12px;white-space:pre-wrap}.experiment-drawer details{font-size:11px;color:#7b8da3;overflow-wrap:anywhere}
</style>
